  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "M2I",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nM2I provides synchronized multi-camera observations together with 3D object annotations for infrastructure perception.\nThe dataset includes\n\nMulti-camera RGB images\nCamera calibration (intrinsics and extrinsics)\n3D bounding box annotations\nBEV semantic maps\nTemporal sequences\nCamera visibility information\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Features\n\t\n\nCompared with existing infrastructure perception datasets, M2I provides:\n\nDiverse road layouts (intersections, highways, roundabouts\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/handsomeYun/M2I.",
  "alternateName": [
    "handsomeYun/M2I"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Yun Zhang",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/handsomeYun"
  },
